期限；截止期限；截止日期</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"214481\">すべてのレポートは<ruby>期限<rp>(</rp><rt>きげん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>守<rp>(</rp><rt>まも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>って<ruby>提出<rp>(</rp><rt>ていしゅつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>されなければならない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">All essays must be handed in on time.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">機嫌</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きげん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">心情；情绪；脾气；心境；安康；安好；安否；心情好；情绪高涨；高兴；愉快；兴致勃勃</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"102612\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>他人<rp>(</rp><rt>たにん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>機嫌<rp>(</rp><rt>きげん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>損<rp>(</rp><rt>そこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ねないように<ruby>気<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をつけている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He is chary of offending people.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">起源</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きげん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">起源；开端；源头</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"103183\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>生命<rp>(</rp><rt>せいめい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>起源<rp>(</rp><rt>きげん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にまで<ruby>説<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>き<ruby>及<rp>(</rp><rt>およ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He even referred to the origin of life.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">機構</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きこう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">机制；机械装置；系统；结构；组织；框架</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"201011\">どこか<ruby>機構<rp>(</rp><rt>きこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>悪<rp>(</rp><rt>わる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いに<ruby>違<rp>(</rp><rt>ちが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Something must be wrong with the machinery.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">気候</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きこう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">气候</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"210607\">その<ruby>国<rp>(</rp><rt>くに</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>気候<rp>(</rp><rt>きこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>温和<rp>(</rp><rt>おんわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">That country has a mild climate.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">聞こえる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きこえる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">听得见；听得到；传入耳朵；听起来；显得；给人的印象；有名；出名；闻名；听得进去；接受（说法）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"226968\">お<ruby>前<rp>(</rp><rt>まえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にはあの<ruby>音<rp>(</rp><rt>おと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>聞<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>こえないのか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Can&#x27;t you hear the sound?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">既婚</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きこん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">已婚；已婚的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"183400\"><ruby>既婚<rp>(</rp><rt>きこん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>女性<rp>(</rp><rt>じょせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>家<rp>(</rp><rt>いえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>や<ruby>夫<rp>(</rp><rt>おっと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>や<ruby>子供<rp>(</rp><rt>こども</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たちの<ruby>面倒<rp>(</rp><rt>めんどう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ることがどんなことか、<ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>知<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">She knew what it was like for married women to look after houses, husbands and children.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">記号</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きごう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">符号；记号；标志</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"237582\">＆という<ruby>記号<rp>(</rp><rt>きごう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は、ａｎｄを<ruby>指<rp>(</rp><rt>さ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>す。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The sign &#x27;&amp;&#x27; stands for &#x27;and&#x27;.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">記載</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きさい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">记载；记录；条目；陈述；登载</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"126